      "about": "A `record_upserted` of the `sys.setting` `view_kept.loan_days`, which asks for the view `loan_days` to be kept. It is the setting's first version, so it carries `made`. The vector holds the line, not a lake that declares the view.",
      "line": "{\"body\":{\"key\":\"view_kept.loan_days\",\"kind\":\"record_upserted\",\"made\":true,\"patch\":{\"key\":\"view_kept.loan_days\",\"value\":true},\"type\":\"sys.setting\",\"version\":1},\"context\":{\"depth\":0,\"origin\":\"direct\"},\"fence\":1,\"hash\":\"7ba5b14d1ed407410a280844fadffe3c0794f415a63ae38e6786d51c6fba182d\",\"id\":\"7b1f4e9a2c6d4835b0a7e3c1d5f29b64\",\"known_at\":\"2026-10-05T08:00:00.000000Z\",\"lake\":\"vectors\",\"origin\":\"authored\",\"position\":27,\"prev\":\"744bbe32b35541ae85da17f287b06b876954db443f50560e0ab8d3f8520b2c31\",\"v\":14,\"writer\":\"agent:agent\"}",
