      "shows": "restated",
      "about": "A `write_proposed` whose write is a migration of `loan` that declares `out_on` `sensitive` and changes no stored value: its preflight's report holds `restated`, what `to` states otherwise than the declaration in force (§2.4).",
      "line": "{\"body\":{\"kind\":\"write_proposed\",\"proposal\":\"p-out-on-masked\",\"why\":\"who borrowed when is not for every reader\",\"write\":{\"migration\":{\"to\":{\"field_meta\":true,\"fields\":[{\"authority\":\"authored\",\"name\":\"out_on\",\"on_input_change\":\"keep\",\"required\":false,\"searchable\":false,\"sensitive\":true,\"type\":{\"kind\":\"date_time\"}},{\"authority\":\"authored\",\"name\":\"back_on\",\"on_input_change\":\"keep\",\"required\":false,\"searchable\":false,\"sensitive\":false,\"type\":{\"kind\":\"date_time\"}},{\"authority\":\"derived\",\"depends_on\":[\"out_on\",\"back_on\"],\"derived\":\"floor((back_on - out_on) / 1d)\",\"name\":\"days\",\"on_input_change\":\"keep\",\"required\":false,\"searchable\":false,\"sensitive\":false,\"type\":{\"kind\":\"number\"}}],\"name\":\"loan\",\"relations\":[{\"cardinality\":\"many_to_one\",\"name\":\"borrower\",\"target\":\"loan\"}]}},\"report\":{\"fields\":[],\"from_schema_hash\":\"ef357c24258676b46f36e03e65d41c127d312174b77c6e32b9645e5e3032874e\",\"lossless\":true,\"records_scanned\":1,\"report_id\":\"7c0e9d8b6a5f4e3d2c1b0a9f8e7d6c5b4a3f2e1d0c9b8a7f6e5d4c3b2a1f0e9d\",\"restated\":[{\"field\":\"out_on\",\"member\":\"sensitive\",\"to\":true,\"was\":false}],\"to_schema_hash\":\"ef357c24258676b46f36e03e65d41c127d312174b77c6e32b9645e5e3032874e\",\"type\":\"loan\"},\"write\":\"migrate\"}},\"context\":{\"depth\":0,\"origin\":\"direct\"},\"fence\":1,\"hash\":\"740c391425fa65e675358bff9715fc5824c0cb316f8b4648f0f60d7a89353a8b\",\"id\":\"4d9a2f7c1e6b4380a5c8f1d3b7e09a26\",\"known_at\":\"2026-10-05T09:00:01.000000Z\",\"lake\":\"vectors\",\"origin\":\"authored\",\"position\":29,\"prev\":\"18c517588093469d0d61bf9845ab0637be29901efb6ef23a49e1f4c1a000255e\",\"v\":14,\"writer\":\"agent:agent\"}",
